  = {{enum|Child|###.IP.Interface.{i}.IPv6Prefix.{i}.Origin}} or
  {{enum|AutoConfigured|###.IP.Interface.{i}.IPv6Prefix.{i}.Origin}}
  associated with the interface instance referenced by
